SRI24 Atlas — License and Attribution
=====================================

The data files in this directory (`atlas_seg_256.nii.gz`, `atlas_t1_256.nii.gz`)
are derived from the SRI24 atlas of normal adult human brain structure. They are
NOT covered by the MIT license that applies to the software in this repository
(see the top-level `LICENSE`).

Original work
-------------
  SRI24: Normal Adult Brain Anatomy
  Torsten Rohlfing, Natalie M. Zahr, Edith V. Sullivan, Adolf Pfefferbaum
  SRI International, Neuroscience Program
  https://www.nitrc.org/projects/sri24/

License
-------
The SRI24 atlas is distributed by its authors under a Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike license (CC-BY-SA). As stated on the NITRC project page:

  "This license lets others remix, tweak, and build upon your work even for
   commercial reasons, as long as they credit you and license their new
   creations under the identical terms."

  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/

The upstream distribution states "CC-BY-SA" without naming a version number; the
terms above are reproduced as published by the atlas authors.

Because the files in this directory are derivative works of the SRI24 atlas,
they are redistributed here under those same CC-BY-SA terms. Anyone who further
modifies or redistributes them must likewise credit the original authors and
license the result under identical terms.

Required citation
-----------------
As per the CC-BY-SA license, please cite the following paper in any publication
that uses the SRI24 atlas:

  T. Rohlfing, N. M. Zahr, E. V. Sullivan, and A. Pfefferbaum,
  "The SRI24 multichannel atlas of normal adult human brain structure,"
  Human Brain Mapping, vol. 31, no. 5, pp. 798-819, 2010.
  doi:10.1002/hbm.20906

